!|y0000000C000000001a1a000000marin|c00|1T4L3D919K00
!|1t1The electronic world known as the|1t1information superhighway just took
!|1t1a left turn thanks to a small company|1t1in California named TeleGrafix
!|1t1Communications, Inc.  They released|1t1a new version of their previously
!|1t1available RIPscrip graphics techno-|1t1logy last week.  This new level of
!|1t1online graphics allows anybody who
!|1t1runs an online service to show their
!|1t1customers high-quality graphics,  |1t1photos and audio clips over normal 
!|1t0telephone lines.|1t1   What makes all of this possible is
!|1t1the way that RIPscrip is designed -
!|1t1the entire language is entirely text- 
!|1t1based.  Unlike other textual graphics|1E
!|!
!|!
!|1T9L4TDF6B00|1t1languages, RIPscrip is very|1t1compact by design.  This
!|1t1allows for very extensive gra-|1t1phics to be shown without bog-|1E
!|1TDP4THI6B00|1t1ging down the telephone con-
!|1t1nection.  A side-effect of its|1t1text nature is that it can|1E
!|!
!|y0000030C000000001a1a000000marin|c2Y|@FR63Continued...
!|!
!|!
!|! 1t1be transmitted over any online service that
!|! 1t1can transmit text.  That is over 99.9% of
!|! 1t1the online community.  This makes
!|! 1t1it perfectly suited for the Internet
!|! 1t1and the nearly 100,000 BBS systems
!|! 1t1throughout the world servicing
!|! 1t0millions of computer users.
!|! 1t1   With the addition of JPEG images,
!|! 1t1digitized sound, 24-bit color, and a
!|! 1t1high-tech font system, RIPscrip has
!|! 1t1the means to launch the online world
!|! 1t0into the 21st century.
!|!
!|!
!|c00|l0D9Q6GHD6GHD6KHI6KHI9GHD9GHD9K9Q9K9Q9G9L9G9L6K9Q6K9Q6G|S0166|B9U6JH99H
