!|y00000X0G000000001a1a000000Sanskrit Roman
!|@DJ70New York Times Co. to Use RIPscrip|y00000X0A00000000251a000000dixon
!|@DJ7IBy PAT CLAWSON
!|!
!|!
!|y0000000A000000001a1a000000marin
!|!
!|1TA07QH39L00
!|1t1   The New York Times Co. announced recently that it will be using 
!|1t1the RIPscrip graphics technology for its online newspaper system in
!|1t1Gainesville, Florida.  This marks the first large-scale newspaper 
!|1t1to use the graphics standard which has taken the online community
!|1t1by storm.  RIPscrip is available in over 50% of the terminals
!|1t1programs available today in over 95% of BBS software packages.|1E
